            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set the text of the second <code>div</code> by using <code>.nextElementSibling.innerHTML</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"HUD Messages\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"firstElement\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"firstSibling\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".body.firstElementChild.nextElementSibling.innerHTML =\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level Up! +1 Strength&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>.</code> followed by <code>nextElementSibling</code> and then <code>.</code>, <code>innerHTML</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which instruction do we use to create a new element?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>document.createElement()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>document.getElementById()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>parent.appendChild()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>document.createElement()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which code goes between the parentheses of <code>document.createElement()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The type of element, like <code>\"img\"</code> for an <code>img</code> element</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The element's ID value</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The name of the variable that stores the element</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The type of element, like <code>\"img\"</code> for an <code>img</code> element.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set the value needed to create an <em>unordered</em> list. Good job!</p><p>Please keep in mind that the list won't appear in the browser yet because it has not been added to the body.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".createElement(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ul&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>ul</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When do we use the <code>.appendChild()</code> instruction?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">When we want to add a child element inside a parent element</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">When we want to create a new element</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">When we want to remove an element</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">When we want to add a child element inside a parent element.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 149046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Include the newly created image into the body with the <code>appendChild</code> instruction.</p><p>Keep in mind that the content won't show in the browser because it has not been added to the body.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"149\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" img = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".createElement(\" /><text value=\"&quot;img&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parent = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".querySelector(\" /><text value=\"&quot;body&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"img.src = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/hero.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"parent.appendChild(img);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>appendChild</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 149047,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does the <code>.removeChild()</code> instruction do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It removes a nested element from its parent</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It appends a new element to its parent</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It removes all child elements of a parent</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It removes a nested element from its parent.</p></body></html>"
          },
